{"title":"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/6/556ebaf57bf6ec5ea437335cc58eaeb48060c451.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n + 5 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />, the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/7/eb7d7b7183a426af11357550370d7ede2aee4b61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n - 3$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad1092cae29d809aabfe5a4fcb08eb6a898ef307.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   8  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   10  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   18  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   14 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   7  \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"412\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/7/a87da3cd79a3d7dcf2938afb03b584e095672936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n + 5 - 8 = 2n - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"160\" height=\"15\" />, so we can subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> from both sides of the equation:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/d/37dc06122042583936e0934155e054c6154feb96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n - 3 = 16 - 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"207\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley\">2014 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3 (page does not